= Stanisław Dubois

Dubois keeps his place in the pool of the continuation from 1930. He represents Lewica PPS and concentrates on socialist youth and workers’ self-defence.

His actions are recorded for chapter 2 (Z — 0.29, M17); in this chapter he cannot be appointed.

